    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Kate Holloway",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105842304843608518303/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJuNlGzSghlWp-wFgxG_FRnGly3IEOJsST_rD9n9hLyTozjng=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "Shopped this location on 25/07/2025, the two women working the women's changing room area, were friendly, pleasant to work with, and very helpful when needing other sizes.  Cashier was also friendly, and discovered we could apply CT points to our purchase.  Prices match the quality of the items, but sales can be found.  However, if you find something on the sales rack you like, buy now, as it will be gone quickly!",
        "time": 1753548863,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jason Hutch",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111556831398864593876/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVoi4X-DMeu-Nc8r-nod6BhgeksRUTJ6Qf6X9tJiePoXZtPZW0=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Went in looking for a specific shoe on a Sunday.  Young man at the shoe section was helpful and as I asked for different sizes, he came out with what I needed.  The shoes were perfect.  89$ Sketchers to fit my wife feet.\n\nAt the cash, the 3 ladies and 1 gentleman were a good team, in constant communication and smiles.\n\nAll in all a great experience and will go back for my next pair of shoes.",
        "time": 1684761644,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "kari t",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114357001504676971058/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWCdU2XWxokNhAYABlzC7BHstCTALBQ_w6R2YD1jEXsKEHtcZt2=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I went there today just to see if I can find something nice for my son for christmas. NO ONE said hello to me even though they saw me coming in and walking around. What’s wrong with you guys!?!\n\nMy son told me the other day also that he was the only one who got caught when 4-5 people including him were leaving the store at the same time and the security alarm went off at the door. He said that this was happened to him maybe  because he was the only non-white man that moment. The store manager questioned him what he stole from the store in such a decisive manner.  He was only wearing T-shirts and shorts on that day. He had no where to hide things  if it was really him.\n\nWell, we don’t know the true reason for it but at least I can say that they are not friendly people and for sure this store is not open for everyone.\n\nIf you don’t want to feel “not welcomed”, please don’t go there. We don’t deserve it.",
        "time": 1733885252,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "john kelly",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110633170742388831159/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLabWvqpDHOE0y80CyW8XfvOjcgLO7V9xY3oA0aE4k8wNrt1Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Had some issues with my new skates ,the store representative in hockey department was absolutely the best .This young man was knowledgeable, professional, and very easy to deal with ,will return for sure",
        "time": 1743254001,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Denis Drouin",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117143707448247849635/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIXOasWQfGWJN6GC1YTIGwOGtqFuXILQzXfV3H0OawW8iB6SA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Went to this store in Vaudreuil to buy Brooks running shoes and I never in my life received such poor service. First we had to go get him because he wasn't interested then asked for help just to be disapointed that he did not care about helping us. Could add more but nothing will change our opinion of this store.",
        "time": 1743724497,
        "translated": false
      }
